OL,3,ANew Zealand PM says election 'too close
OL,4,Ato call' with result yet to be declared
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the centrist Opportunity
OL,7,FParty crosses the 5% threshold to enter
OL,8,Fparliament for the first time with
OL,9,Fleader Qiulae Wong saying she'll work
OL,10,Fwith either side
OL,12,FNew Zealand's voting system - mixed
OL,13,Fmember proportional - means most
OL,14,Fgovernments are coalitions
